  "1ebd6867-062d-4c61-8f22-eaeae2c795be"],
 " \[LongDash] same expression and type, opposite direction.",
 "\n",
 Cell["   ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->"4638522f-908f-4e56-b2d9-56da08faf3ad"],
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   TemplateBox[{
     Cell[
